    "detailed_description": "You, a shipwrecked sailor, wash up on a strange island at the edge of the known world. As you explore this mysterious island you must battle monsters and the undead. You must find weapons and equipment to upgrade your abilities and finally you must take defeat the evil sorcerer that rules this island. Along the way you will find friends, search for treasure and test your abilities as a swordsman.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818690/extras/c14dcb08431ccdd749d32b725f870ba1.poster.avif?t=1755288648\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818690/extras/c14dcb08431ccdd749d32b725f870ba1.webm?t=1755288648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818690/extras/c14dcb08431ccdd749d32b725f870ba1.mp4?t=1755288648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Realtime Combat<br></li><li>Wide Variety of historically inspired weapons<br></li><li>Deep Physics Simulation<br></li><li>Seamless open world<br></li><li>Inventory system<br></li><li>Killer Original Soundtrack<br></li><li>Controller Support</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "You, a shipwrecked sailor, wash up on a strange island at the edge of the known world. As you explore this mysterious island you must battle monsters and the undead. You must find weapons and equipment to upgrade your abilities and finally you must take defeat the evil sorcerer that rules this island. Along the way you will find friends, search for treasure and test your abilities as a swordsman.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818690/extras/c14dcb08431ccdd749d32b725f870ba1.poster.avif?t=1755288648\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818690/extras/c14dcb08431ccdd749d32b725f870ba1.webm?t=1755288648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818690/extras/c14dcb08431ccdd749d32b725f870ba1.mp4?t=1755288648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Realtime Combat<br></li><li>Wide Variety of historically inspired weapons<br></li><li>Deep Physics Simulation<br></li><li>Seamless open world<br></li><li>Inventory system<br></li><li>Killer Original Soundtrack<br></li><li>Controller Support</li></ul>",
